{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>步入秋季，安徽九華山風景區出現如夢似幻的霧景。清晨時分，山峰從緩緩升起的縷縷霧氣中時隱時現，在晨光映照下形成令人讚嘆的景致。</p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"8503309_安徽九華山 雲霧秋景如畫.mp4 - 截图6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/edddc7c300e14dafacc831d104e568bc/snapshots/8e080ac614ce47cca4d4de302aef6407-00006.jpg\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p>蓮花峰山腳下，一條村莊被薄如面紗的霧氣籠罩，配合柔和的晨光，構成寧靜的秋日田園風光。九華山是中國佛教四大名山之一，亦是國家地質公園。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T00:44:22.823734+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T01:38:15.463701+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T00:38:22.267914+00:00","content_hash":"2ed4026f958475eee71929dc8865f702fd645550e305bd4ffb48cf56bfced306","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T00:44:22.823734+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}